# Scoped to this directory's `Dockerfile` alone: BuildKit reads `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` before the
# context's own. The context is `benches/compare/`, and the image compiles only `cases/` and
# `scenarios/`.
#
# `generated/` holds the copies a row serves. The `deploy-switch` row makes a symlink there from inside
# a container, which a Windows host cannot open, so sending it fails the whole build.
generated/
